msgstr "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>XML-RPC ser ut til å være riktig konfigurert."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_keys_and_salts.php:32
msgid ""
"WordPress security authentication or secret key or SALT keys, are the encrypted code that protects your login information. \n"
"                                                                Salt keys are cryptographic elements used to 'hash' data in order to secure it. In fact, most serious platforms and systems use similar mechanisms to protect sensitive data."
msgstr ""
"WordPress-sikkerhetsautentisering eller hemmelig nøkkel eller SALT-nøkler, er den krypterte koden som beskytter din påloggingsinformasjon. \n"
"                                                                Salt-nøkler er kryptografiske elementer brukt til å 'hashe' data for å sikre den. Faktisk bruker de fleste seriøse plattformer og systemer lignende mekanismer for å beskytte sensitive data."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_keys_and_salts.php:69
msgid "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>The Authentication unique keys and salts are empty or invalid."
msgstr "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>Autentiserings-unike nøkler og salter er tomme eller ugyldige."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_keys_and_salts.php:79
msgid "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>The Authentication unique keys and salts are correctly set-up."
msgstr "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>Autentiserings-unike nøkler og salter er riktig satt opp."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_mysql_version.php:32
msgid "Using a higher MySQL version ensures better capability for your system. Older versions are often exploitable making the system unstable and predisposing to security breaches."
msgstr "Bruk av en høyere MySQL-versjon sikrer bedre kapabilitet for systemet ditt. Eldre versjoner er ofte utnyttbare og gjør systemet ustabilt og utsatt for sikkerhetsbrudd."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_mysql_version.php:47 include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_version.php:47 include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_wp_version.php:50 include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_wp_version_stability.php:49
msgid "Using Version: "
msgstr "Bruker versjon: "

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_mysql_version.php:52 include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_version.php:53
msgid "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span> You are using at least the minimum recommended PHP version."
