msgstr "<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-yes\"></span>register_globals er AV."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_safe_mode.php:32
msgid "The PHP safe mode is an attempt to solve the shared-server security problem. It is architecturally incorrect to try to solve this problem at the PHP level, but since the alternatives at the web server and OS levels aren't very realistic, many people, especially ISP's, use safe mode for now."
msgstr "PHP safe mode er et forsøk på å løse delt server-sikkerhetsproblemet. Det er arkitektonisk feil å prøve å løse dette problemet på PHP-nivå, men siden alternativene på web-server og OS-nivåer ikke er veldig realistiske, bruker mange, spesielt ISP'er, safe mode for øyeblikket."

#: include/admin-interfaces/security-scan/scan_item_php_safe_mode.php:48
msgid ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>The register_globals is ON. \n"
"                                                                        To fix this security issue, change the php.ini:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /><code>safe_mode = \"off\"</code>\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br />or within .htaccess:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /><code>php_flag safe_mode off</code>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>register_globals er PÅ. \n"
"                                                                        For å fikse dette sikkerhetsproblemet, endre php.ini:\n"
