#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:89
msgid "This blocks the default XML-RPC service. The functionality applies if <b>New XML-RPC Path</b> option is filled in."
msgstr "Dette blokkerer standard XML-RPC tjeneste. Funksjonaliteten gjelder hvis <b>Ny XML-RPC Sti</b> alternativet er fylt ut."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:90
msgid "Keep in mind that some third-party services, like Jetpack, rely on XML-RPC to connect to WordPress sites for features such as monitoring, statistics, and site management."
msgstr "Husk at noen tredjepartstjenester, som Jetpack, er avhengige av XML-RPC for å koble til WordPress-sider for funksjoner som overvåkning, statistikk og sideadministrasjon."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:102 modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:105
msgid "Disable XML-RPC methods requiring authentication"
msgstr "Deaktiver XML-RPC metoder som krever autentisering"

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:103
msgid "Filter XML-RPC methods requiring authentication, such as for publishing purposes, are enabled."
msgstr "Filtrer XML-RPC metoder som krever autentisering, for eksempel for publiseringsformål, er aktivert."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:106
msgid "As default, certain methods require authentication for the protocol to be used along with a remote application (e.g., wp.restoreRevision, wp.getRevisions, wp.getPostTypes, wp.getPostType, wp.getPostFormats, wp.getMediaLibrary, wp.getMediaItem etc)."
msgstr "Som standard krever visse metoder autentisering for at protokollen skal brukes sammen med en fjernapplikasjon (f.eks. wp.restoreRevision, wp.getRevisions, wp.getPostTypes, wp.getPostType, wp.getPostFormats, wp.getMediaLibrary, wp.getMediaItem etc)."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:107
msgid "Activating the option, methods requiring authentication will be blocked through a call."
msgstr "Ved aktivering av alternativet, vil metoder som krever autentisering bli blokkert gjennom et kall."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:108
msgid "Brute force attacks often target the XML-RPC service. Therefore, it's advisable to enable this option unless you are using the service for specific purposes, such as with a remote mobile app."
msgstr "Brute force-angrep retter seg ofte mot XML-RPC-tjenesten. Derfor er det tilrådelig å aktivere dette alternativet med mindre du bruker tjenesten for spesifikke formål, som med en fjern mobilapp."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:120 modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:123
msgid "Disable XML-RPC service"
msgstr "Deaktiver XML-RPC tjeneste"

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:121
msgid "When the XML-RPC service is deactivated, any calls to it result in the server returning a default 404 Not Found error page."
msgstr "Når XML-RPC-tjenesten er deaktivert, vil alle kall til den resultere i at serveren returnerer en standard 404 Not Found feilside."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:124
msgid "Before disabling the XML-RPC, ensure the service is not used for any of the followings:"
msgstr "Før du deaktiverer XML-RPC, sørg for at tjenesten ikke brukes til noe av følgende:"

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:125
msgid "Mobile Apps: XML-RPC allows users to manage their WordPress sites via mobile apps. This feature makes it convenient for bloggers and administrators to create, edit, or delete posts from smartphones and tablets."
msgstr "Mobilapper: XML-RPC lar brukere administrere sine WordPress-sider via mobilapper. Denne funksjonen gjør det praktisk for bloggere og administratorer å opprette, redigere eller slette innlegg fra smarttelefoner og nettbrett."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:126
msgid "Third-Party Services: Many third-party services, like Jetpack, rely on XML-RPC to connect to WordPress sites for features such as monitoring, statistics, and site management."
msgstr "Tredjepartstjenester: Mange tredjepartstjenester, som Jetpack, er avhengige av XML-RPC for å koble til WordPress-sider for funksjoner som overvåkning, statistikk og sideadministrasjon."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:127
msgid "Content Syndication: XML-RPC can be used to syndicate content between different WordPress sites, sharing posts and updates."
msgstr "Innholdssyndikering: XML-RPC kan brukes til å syndikere innhold mellom forskjellige WordPress-sider, dele innlegg og oppdateringer."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:128
msgid "The Benefits of Disabling XML-RPC:"
msgstr "Fordelene med å deaktivere XML-RPC:"

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:129
msgid "Improved Security: Disabling XML-RPC eliminates a potential entry point for attackers, protecting your site from brute force attacks and other malicious activities."
msgstr "Forbedret sikkerhet: Deaktivering av XML-RPC eliminerer et potensielt inngangspunkt for angripere, og beskytter din side mot brute force-angrep og andre ondsinnede aktiviteter."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:130
msgid "Reduced Server Load: By preventing DDoS attacks through XML-RPC, you can reduce the load on your server and improve site performance and availability."
msgstr "Redusert serverbelastning: Ved å forhindre DDoS-angrep gjennom XML-RPC kan du redusere belastningen på serveren din og forbedre sidens ytelse og tilgjengelighet."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:131
msgid "Better Control: Disabling XML-RPC ensures that your site remains under your control, minimizing the risk of unauthorized access or content manipulation."
msgstr "Bedre kontroll: Deaktivering av XML-RPC sikrer at din side forblir under din kontroll, og minimerer risikoen for uautorisert tilgang eller innholdsmanipulasjon."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:144 modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:147
msgid "Remove pingback"
msgstr "Fjern pingback"

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:145
msgid "Remove pingback link tag from theme."
msgstr "Fjern pingback lenke-tag fra tema."

#: modules/components/rewrite-xml-rpc-path.php:148
msgid "A pingback is one of four types of link-back methods for Web authors to request notification when somebody links to one of their documents. This enables authors to keep track of who is linking to, or referring to their articles. Using this option, this functionality can be removed."
msgstr "En pingback er en av fire typer link-back metoder for web-forfattere for å be om varsling når noen lenker til et av deres dokumenter. Dette gjør at forfattere kan holde oversikt over hvem som lenker til eller refererer til deres artikler. Ved å bruke dette alternativet kan denne funksjonaliteten fjernes."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:43
msgid "Allows a server to declare an embedder policy for a given document."
msgstr "Tillater en server å deklarere en innbydningspolicy for et gitt dokument."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:49
msgid "Prevents other domains from opening/controlling a window."
msgstr "Forhindrer andre domener fra å åpne/kontrollere et vindu."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:55
msgid "Prevents other domains from reading the response of the resources to which this header is applied."
msgstr "Forhindrer andre domener fra å lese svaret til ressursene som denne headeren er brukt på."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:61
msgid "Controls resources the user agent is allowed to load for a given page."
msgstr "Kontrollerer ressurser som brukeragenten har lov til å laste for en gitt side."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:67
msgid "Allows web developers to experiment with policies by monitoring, but not enforcing, their effects. These violation reports consist of JSON documents sent via an HTTP POST request to the specified URI."
msgstr "Tillater webutviklere å eksperimentere med policyer ved å overvåke, men ikke håndheve, deres effekter. Disse overtredelsesrapportene består av JSON-dokumenter sendt via en HTTP POST-forespørsel til den angitte URI-en."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:73 modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:50
msgid "Provides a mechanism to allow and deny the use of browser features in its own frame, and in iframes that it embeds."
msgstr "Gir en mekanisme for å tillate og nekte bruk av nettleserfunksjoner i sin egen ramme, og i iframes som den inneholder."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:79
msgid "A policy that controls how much information is shared through the HTTP referrer header. Helps to protect user privacy."
msgstr "En policy som kontrollerer hvor mye informasjon som deles gjennom HTTP referrer headeren. Hjelper til med å beskytte brukerens personvern."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:85
msgid "Force communication using HTTPS instead of HTTP."
msgstr "Tving kommunikasjon ved å bruke HTTPS i stedet for HTTP."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:91
msgid "Disables MIME sniffing and forces browser to use the type given in Content-Type."
msgstr "Deaktiverer MIME-sniffing og tvinger nettleseren til å bruke typen gitt i Content-Type."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:97
msgid "The X-Download-Options HTTP header indicates that the browser (Internet Explorer) should not display the option to \"Open\" a file that has been downloaded from an application, to prevent phishing attacks as the file otherwise would gain access to execute in the context of the application."
msgstr "X-Download-Options HTTP-headeren indikerer at nettleseren (Internet Explorer) ikke skal vise alternativet for å \"Åpne\" en fil som er lastet ned fra en applikasjon, for å forhindre phishing-angrep ettersom filen ellers ville få tilgang til å kjøre i applikasjonens kontekst."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:103
msgid "Indicates whether a browser should be allowed to render a page in a &#60;frame&#62;, &#60;iframe&#62;, &#60;embed&#62; or &#60;object&#62;"
msgstr "Angir om en nettleser skal tillates å gjengi en side i en &#60;frame&#62;, &#60;iframe&#62;, &#60;embed&#62; eller &#60;object&#62;"

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:109
msgid "Specifies if a cross-domain policy file (crossdomain.xml) is allowed. The file may define a policy to grant clients, such as Adobe's Flash Player (now obsolete), Adobe Acrobat, Microsoft Silverlight (now obsolete), or Apache Flex, permission to handle data across domains that would otherwise be restricted due to the Same-Origin Policy. See the Cross-domain Policy File Specification for more information."
msgstr "Spesifiserer om en cross-domain policy fil (crossdomain.xml) er tillatt. Filen kan definere en policy for å gi klienter, som Adobe's Flash Player (nå foreldet), Adobe Acrobat, Microsoft Silverlight (nå foreldet), eller Apache Flex, tillatelse til å håndtere data på tvers av domener som ellers ville være begrenset på grunn av Same-Origin Policy. Se Cross-domain Policy File Specification for mer informasjon."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:115
msgid "Created for browsers equipped with XSS filters, this non-standard header was intended as a way to control the filtering functionality."
msgstr "Opprettet for nettlesere utstyrt med XSS-filtre, denne ikke-standard headeren var ment som en måte å kontrollere filterfunksjonaliteten på."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:135
msgid "Check Headers"
msgstr "Sjekk Headere"

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:138
msgid "HTTP Response Headers are a powerful tool to Harden Your Website.<br />Misusing the headers, can easily break the site layout and functionality. Ensure you understand the proper usage for each option before configuring. Once the Headers setup is completed, a thorough check for the front side is recommended."
msgstr "HTTP Response Headers er et kraftig verktøy for å styrke din nettside.<br />Feil bruk av headerne kan lett ødelegge sidens layout og funksjonalitet. Forsikre deg om at du forstår riktig bruk for hvert alternativ før konfigurering. Når Header-oppsettet er fullført, anbefales en grundig sjekk for frontsiden."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:140
msgid "Copy the following link to a safe place. You can use it to reset the header options if something goes wrong:"
msgstr "Kopier følgende lenke til et trygt sted. Du kan bruke den til å tilbakestille header-alternativene hvis noe går galt:"

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:143
msgid "Create a sample setup for Headers. That will overwrite any Headers settings previously created through the plugin options. The sample setup creates a basic Headers implementation that is commonly safe on any site. For better performances, further manual adjustments are necessary."
msgstr "Opprett en prøveoppsett for Headere. Dette vil overskrive alle Header-innstillinger som tidligere er opprettet gjennom plugin-alternativene. Prøveoppsettet oppretter en grunnleggende Header-implementering som vanligvis er trygg på enhver side. For bedre ytelse er ytterligere manuelle justeringer nødvendige."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:143
msgid "Create Sample Setup"
msgstr "Opprett Prøveoppsett"

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:145
msgid "The Hypertext Transfer Protocol (HTTP) is based on a client-server architecture, in which the client ( typically a web browser application ) establishes a connection with the server through a destination URL and waits for a response."
msgstr "Hypertext Transfer Protocol (HTTP) er basert på en klient-server arkitektur, der klienten (vanligvis en nettleserapplikasjon) etablerer en tilkobling med serveren gjennom en destinasjons-URL og venter på et svar."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:146
msgid "The HTTP Headers allow the client and the server send additional pieces of information with the HTTP request or response."
msgstr "HTTP Headerne tillater klienten og serveren å sende ekstra informasjon med HTTP-forespørselen eller svaret."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:147
msgid "The HTTP Headers are categorised by their purpose: Authentication, Caching, Client hints, Conditionals, Connection management, Content negotiation, Controls, Cookies, CORS, Downloads, Message body information, Proxies, Redirects, Request context, Response context, Range requests, <b>Security</b>, Server-sent events, Transfer coding, WebSockets, etc."
msgstr "HTTP Headerne er kategorisert etter deres formål: Autentisering, Caching, Client hints, Conditionals, Connection management, Content negotiation, Controls, Cookies, CORS, Downloads, Message body information, Proxies, Redirects, Request context, Response context, Range requests, <b>Sikkerhet</b>, Server-sent events, Transfer coding, WebSockets, etc."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:148
msgid "This area provides support for the <b>"
msgstr "Dette området gir støtte for <b>"

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:148
msgid " type. Those are the ones responsible for the security implementation for any page."
msgstr " type. Disse er de som er ansvarlige for sikkerhetsimplementeringen for enhver side."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:174
msgid "The current protection level is"
msgstr "Nåværende beskyttelsesnivå er"

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:186
msgid "Check Current Headers"
msgstr "Sjekk Nåværende Headere"

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:209
msgid "<br />Unable to parse the site Headers. The wp_remote_head() returned an invalid Response, check with your host support for more details.  Unable to identify your site Headers."
msgstr "<br />Kan ikke parse sidens Headere. wp_remote_head() returnerte et ugyldig svar, sjekk med din host support for flere detaljer. Kan ikke identifisere sidens Headere."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:221
msgid "<br />Invalid WP_HTTP_Requests_Response object. The wp_remote_head() returned an invalid Response, check with your host support for more details."
msgstr "<br />Ugyldig WP_HTTP_Requests_Response objekt. wp_remote_head() returnerte et ugyldig svar, sjekk med din host support for flere detaljer."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:230
msgid "<br />Unable to parse the site Headers. The wp_remote_head() returns invalid Response Code, check with your host support for more details."
msgstr "<br />Kan ikke parse sidens Headere. wp_remote_head() returnerer ugyldig Response Code, sjekk med din host support for flere detaljer."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:240
msgid "<br />Unable to parse the site Headers. The wp_remote_head() returns a 401 error code, the request could not be authenticated. Does the site use an httpd password?"
msgstr "<br />Kan ikke parse sidens Headere. wp_remote_head() returnerer en 401 feilkode, forespørselen kunne ikke autentiseres. Bruker siden et httpd-passord?"

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:247
msgid "<br />Unable to parse the site Headers. The wp_remote_head() returns wrong Response Code"
msgstr "<br />Kan ikke parse sidens Headere. wp_remote_head() returnerer feil Response Code"

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:247
msgid ", check with your host support for more details."
msgstr ", sjekk med din host support for flere detaljer."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:263
msgid "Header"
msgstr "Header"

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:334
msgid "Warning! The following headers could not be found:"
msgstr "Advarsel! Følgende headere kunne ikke finnes:"

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:335
msgid "Ensure the server mod_headers module is active."
msgstr "Forsikre deg om at serverens mod_headers modul er aktiv."

#: modules/components/security-check_headers.php:356
msgid "Consider adding more security headers:"
msgstr "Vurder å legge til flere sikkerhetsheadere:"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:46 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:49
msgid "Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only"
msgstr "Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:50
msgid "The HTTP Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only response header allows web developers to experiment with Content-Security-Policy policies by monitoring (but not enforcing) their effects. These violation reports consist of JSON documents sent via an HTTP POST request to the specified URI."
msgstr "HTTP Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only responsheaderen tillater webutviklere å eksperimentere med Content-Security-Policy policyer ved å overvåke (men ikke håndheve) deres effekter. Disse overtredelsesrapportene består av JSON-dokumenter sendt via en HTTP POST-forespørsel til den angitte URI-en."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:52 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:52 modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:52
msgid "Directives:"
msgstr "Direktiver:"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:53 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:53
msgid "Serves as a fallback for the other fetch directives.."
msgstr "Fungerer som en fallback for de andre hentedirektivene."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:54 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:54
msgid "Defines the valid sources for web workers and nested browsing contexts loaded using elements such as &#60;frame&#62; and &#60;iframe&#62;."
msgstr "Definerer de gyldige kildene for web workers og nested browsing contexts lastet med elementer som &#60;frame&#62; og &#60;iframe&#62;."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:55 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:55
msgid "Restricts the URLs which can be loaded using script interfaces."
msgstr "Begrenser URL-ene som kan lastes ved hjelp av skriptgrensesnitt."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:56 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:56
msgid "Specifies valid sources for fonts loaded using @font-face."
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige kilder for fonter lastet med @font-face."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:57 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:62 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:57 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:62
msgid "Specifies valid sources for nested browsing contexts loading using elements such as &#60;frame&#62; and &#60;iframe&#62;."
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige kilder for nested browsing contexts lasting med elementer som &#60;frame&#62; og &#60;iframe&#62;."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:58 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:58
msgid "Specifies valid sources of images and favicons.."
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige kilder for bilder og favikoner."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:59 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:59
msgid "Specifies valid sources of application manifest files."
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige kilder for applikasjonsmanifestfiler."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:60 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:60
msgid "Specifies valid sources for loading media using the &#60;audio&#62; , &#60;video&#62; and &#60;track&#62; elements."
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige kilder for lasting av media ved hjelp av &#60;audio&#62;, &#60;video&#62; og &#60;track&#62; elementer."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:61 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:61
msgid "Specifies valid sources for the &#60;object&#62;, &#60;embed&#62;, and &#60;applet&#62; elements."
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige kilder for &#60;object&#62;, &#60;embed&#62; og &#60;applet&#62; elementer."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:63 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:63
msgid "Specifies valid sources for JavaScript."
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige kilder for JavaScript."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:64 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:64
msgid "Specifies valid sources for JavaScript &#60;script&#62; elements."
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige kilder for JavaScript &#60;script&#62; elementer."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:65 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:65
msgid "Specifies valid sources for JavaScript inline event handlers."
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige kilder for JavaScript inline event handlers."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:66 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:66
msgid "Specifies valid sources for stylesheets."
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige kilder for stilark."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:67 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:67
msgid "Specifies valid sources for stylesheets &#60;style&#62; elements and &#60;link&#62; elements with rel='stylesheet'. "
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige kilder for stilark &#60;style&#62; elementer og &#60;link&#62; elementer med rel='stylesheet'."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:68 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:68
msgid "Specifies valid sources for inline styles applied to individual DOM elements."
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige kilder for inline stiler brukt på individuelle DOM-elementer."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:69 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:69
msgid "Specifies valid sources for Worker, SharedWorker, or ServiceWorker scripts."
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige kilder for Worker, SharedWorker eller ServiceWorker skript."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:70 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:70
msgid "Restricts the URLs which can be used in a document's &#60;base&#62; element. "
msgstr "Begrenser URL-ene som kan brukes i et dokuments &#60;base&#62; element."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:71 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:71
msgid "Enables a sandbox for the requested resource similar to the &#60;iframe&#62; sandbox attribute."
msgstr "Aktiverer en sandkasse for den forespurte ressursen som ligner på &#60;iframe&#62; sandbox-attributtet."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:72 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:72
msgid "Restricts the URLs which can be used as the target of a form submissions from a given context."
msgstr "Begrenser URL-ene som kan brukes som målet for en skjemainnsending fra en gitt kontekst."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:73 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:73
msgid "Specifies valid parents that may embed a page using &#60;frame&#62;, &#60;iframe&#62;, &#60;object&#62;, &#60;embed&#62;, or &#60;applet&#62;. "
msgstr "Spesifiserer gyldige foreldre som kan bygge inn en side ved hjelp av &#60;frame&#62;, &#60;iframe&#62;, &#60;object&#62;, &#60;embed&#62; eller &#60;applet&#62;."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:74 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:74
msgid "Restricts the URLs to which a document can initiate navigation by any means, including &#60;form&#62; (if form-action is not specified), &#60;a&#62;, window.location, window.open, etc."
msgstr "Begrenser URL-ene som et dokument kan initiere navigering til på noen måte, inkludert &#60;form&#62; (hvis form-action ikke er spesifisert), &#60;a&#62;, window.location, window.open, etc."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:75 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:75
msgid "The directive instructs the user agent to report attempts to violate the Content Security Policy. These violation reports consist of JSON documents sent via an HTTP POST request to the specified URI."
msgstr "Direktivet instruerer brukeragenten om å rapportere forsøk på å krenke Content Security Policy. Disse overtredelsesrapportene består av JSON-dokumenter sendt via en HTTP POST-forespørsel til den angitte URI-en."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:76 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:76
msgid "Fires a SecurityPolicyViolationEvent. These violation reports consist of JSON documents sent via an HTTP POST request to the specified URI."
msgstr "Utløser en SecurityPolicyViolationEvent. Disse overtredelsesrapportene består av JSON-dokumenter sendt via en HTTP POST-forespørsel til den angitte URI-en."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:77 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:77
msgid "Requires the use of SRI for scripts or styles on the page."
msgstr "Krever bruk av SRI for skript eller stiler på siden."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:78 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:78
msgid "Enforces Trusted Types at the DOM XSS injection sinks."
msgstr "Håndhever Trusted Types på DOM XSS injeksjonspunkter."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:79 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:79
msgid "Used to specify an allow-list of Trusted Types policies. Trusted Types allows applications to lock down DOM XSS injection sinks to only accept non-spoofable, typed values in place of strings."
msgstr "Brukes til å spesifisere en tillatelsesliste for Trusted Types policyer. Trusted Types lar applikasjoner låse DOM XSS injeksjonspunkter for kun å akseptere ikke-forfalskbare, typede verdier i stedet for strenger."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:80 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:80
msgid "Instructs user agents to treat all of a site's insecure URLs (those served over HTTP) as though they have been replaced with secure URLs (those served over HTTPS). This directive is intended for web sites with large numbers of insecure legacy URLs that need to be rewritten."
msgstr "Instruerer brukeragenter om å behandle alle en sidens usikre URL-er (de som serveres over HTTP) som om de er erstattet med sikre URL-er (de som serveres over HTTPS). Dette direktivet er ment for nettsider med store mengder usikre eldre URL-er som må omskrives."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:82 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:82
msgid "Values:"
msgstr "Verdier:"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:83 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:83
msgid "Won't allow loading of any resources."
msgstr "Tillater ikke lasting av noen ressurser."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:84 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:84
msgid "Only allow resources from the current origin."
msgstr "Tillater kun ressurser fra gjeldende opprinnelse."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:85 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:85
msgid "The trust granted to a script in the page due to an accompanying nonce or hash is extended to the scripts it loads."
msgstr "Tilliten gitt til et skript på siden på grunn av en medfølgende nonce eller hash utvides til skriptene det laster."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:86 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:86
msgid "Require a sample of the violating code to be included in the violation report."
msgstr "Krever at et utvalg av den krenkende koden inkluderes i overtredelsesrapporten."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:87 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:87
msgid "Allow use of inline resources."
msgstr "Tillat bruk av inline ressurser."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:88 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:88
msgid "Allow use of dynamic code evaluation such as eval, setImmediate , and window.execScript."
msgstr "Tillat bruk av dynamisk kodeevaluering som eval, setImmediate og window.execScript."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:89 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:89
msgid "Only allow loading of resources from a specific host, with optional scheme, port, and path. e.g. example.com, *.example.com, https://*.example.com:12/path/to/file.js."
msgstr "Tillater kun lasting av ressurser fra en spesifikk vert, med valgfri skjema, port og sti. f.eks. example.com, *.example.com, https://*.example.com:12/path/to/file.js."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:90 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:90
msgid "Path parts in the CSP that end in / match any path they are a prefix of. e.g. example.com/api/ will match URLs like example.com/api/users/new."
msgstr "Stideler i CSP som slutter med / matcher enhver sti de er et prefiks av. f.eks. example.com/api/ vil matche URL-er som example.com/api/users/new."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:91 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:91
msgid "Other path parts in the CSP are matched exactly e.g. example.com/file.js will match http://example.com/file.js and https://example.com/file.js, but not https://example.com/file.js/file2.js."
msgstr "Andre stideler i CSP matches nøyaktig f.eks. example.com/file.js vil matche http://example.com/file.js og https://example.com/file.js, men ikke https://example.com/file.js/file2.js."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:92 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:92
msgid "Only allow loading of resources over a specific scheme e.g. https:, http:, data:, mediastream:, blob:, filesystem:"
msgstr "Tillater kun lasting av ressurser over et spesifikt skjema f.eks. https:, http:, data:, mediastream:, blob:, filesystem:"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:93 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:93
msgid "Alternatively, a JavaScript hash can be used instead.  The CSP Level 2 specification allows to compute the SHA-256 / sha384 / sha512 for the inline JavaScript code."
msgstr "Alternativt kan en JavaScript hash brukes i stedet. CSP Level 2-spesifikasjonen tillater å beregne SHA-256 / sha384 / sha512 for den inline JavaScript-koden."

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:158 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:159 modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:93 modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-opener-policy.php:97 modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-resource-policy.php:93 modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:154 modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:99 modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:97 modules/components/security-header-x-content-type-options.php:93 modules/components/security-header-x-download-options.php:91 modules/components/security-header-x-frame-options.php:97 modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:97 modules/components/security-header-x-xss-protection.php:98
msgid "Enable Header"
msgstr "Aktiver Header"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:256 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:257
msgid "report-uri"
msgstr "report-uri"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:263 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:264
msgid "report-to"
msgstr "report-to"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:270 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:271
msgid "sandbox"
msgstr "sandbox"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:328 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:329
msgid "require-sri-for"
msgstr "require-sri-for"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:374 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:375
msgid "block-all-mixed-content"
msgstr "block-all-mixed-content"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy-report-only.php:382 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:383
msgid "upgrade-insecure-requests"
msgstr "upgrade-insecure-requests"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:46 modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:49
msgid "Content-Security-Policy"
msgstr "Content-Security-Policy"

#: modules/components/security-header-content-security-policy.php:50
msgid "The HTTP Content-Security-Policy response header allows web site administrators to control resources the user agent is allowed to load for a given page. With a few exceptions, policies mostly involve specifying server origins and script endpoints. This helps guard against cross-site scripting attacks (Cross-site_scripting)."
msgstr "HTTP Content-Security-Policy responsheaderen lar nettsideadministratorer kontrollere ressurser som brukeragenten har lov til å laste for en gitt side. Med noen få unntak involverer policyer for det meste å spesifisere serveropprinnelser og skriptendepunkter. Dette hjelper til med å beskytte mot tverrside skriptangrep (Cross-site_scripting)."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:47
msgid "Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy (COEP)"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy (COEP)"

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:50
msgid "Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy"

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:51
msgid "The HTTP Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy (COEP) response header prevents a document from loading any cross-origin resources that don't explicitly grant the document permission (using CORP or CORS)."
msgstr "HTTP Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy (COEP) responsheaderen forhindrer et dokument i å laste noen tverropprinnelige ressurser som ikke eksplisitt gir dokumentet tillatelse (ved bruk av CORP eller CORS)."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:52 modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-opener-policy.php:53 modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-resource-policy.php:51 modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:52 modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:52 modules/components/security-header-x-content-type-options.php:53 modules/components/security-header-x-frame-options.php:52 modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:54 modules/components/security-header-x-xss-protection.php:52
msgid "Options:"
msgstr "Alternativer:"

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:53
msgid "This is the default value. Allows the document to fetch cross-origin resources without giving explicit permission through the CORS protocol or the Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy header."
msgstr "Dette er standardverdien. Tillater dokumentet å hente tverropprinnelige ressurser uten å gi eksplisitt tillatelse gjennom CORS-protokollen eller Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy headeren."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:54
msgid "A document can only load resources from the same origin, or resources explicitly marked as loadable from another origin. If a cross origin resource supports CORS, the crossorigin attribute or the Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy header must be used to load it without being blocked by COEP."
msgstr "Et dokument kan bare laste ressurser fra samme opprinnelse, eller ressurser eksplisitt merket som lastbare fra en annen opprinnelse. Hvis en tverropprinnelig ressurs støtter CORS, må crossorigin-attributtet eller Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy headeren brukes for å laste den uten å bli blokkert av COEP."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-embedder-policy.php:104 modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-opener-policy.php:108 modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-resource-policy.php:104 modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:110 modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:108 modules/components/security-header-x-content-type-options.php:104 modules/components/security-header-x-download-options.php:102 modules/components/security-header-x-frame-options.php:108 modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:108 modules/components/security-header-x-xss-protection.php:109
msgid "Header Options"
msgstr "Header Alternativer"

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-opener-policy.php:46
msgid "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy (COOP)"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy (COOP)"

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-opener-policy.php:49
msgid "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy"

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-opener-policy.php:50
msgid "The HTTP Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy (COOP) response header allows you to ensure a top-level document does not share a browsing context group with cross-origin documents."
msgstr "HTTP Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy (COOP) responsheaderen lar deg sikre at et toppnivådokument ikke deler en browsing context gruppe med tverropprinnelige dokumenter."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-opener-policy.php:51
msgid "COOP will process-isolate your document and potential attackers can't access your global object if they were to open it in a popup, preventing a set of cross-origin attacks dubbed XS-Leaks."
msgstr "COOP vil prosess-isolere dokumentet ditt og potensielle angripere kan ikke få tilgang til ditt globale objekt hvis de skulle åpne det i en popup, noe som forhindrer en rekke tverropprinnelige angrep kalt XS-Leaks."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-opener-policy.php:52
msgid "If a cross-origin document with COOP is opened in a new window, the opening document will not have a reference to it, and the window.opener property of the new window will be null. This allows you to have more control over references to a window than rel=noopener, which only affects outgoing navigations."
msgstr "Hvis et tverropprinnelig dokument med COOP åpnes i et nytt vindu, vil åpningsdokumentet ikke ha en referanse til det, og window.opener-egenskapen til det nye vinduet vil være null. Dette gir deg mer kontroll over referanser til et vindu enn rel=noopener, som bare påvirker utgående navigeringer."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-opener-policy.php:54
msgid "This is the default value. Allows the document to be added to its opener's browsing context group unless the opener itself has a COOP of same-origin or same-origin-allow-popups."
msgstr "Dette er standardverdien. Tillater dokumentet å bli lagt til i åpnerens browsing context gruppe med mindre åpneren selv har en COOP av same-origin eller same-origin-allow-popups."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-opener-policy.php:55
msgid "Retains references to newly opened windows or tabs that either don't set COOP or that opt out of isolation by setting a COOP of unsafe-none."
msgstr "Beholder referanser til nylig åpnede vinduer eller faner som enten ikke setter COOP eller som velger bort isolasjon ved å sette en COOP av unsafe-none."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-opener-policy.php:56
msgid "Isolates the browsing context exclusively to same-origin documents. Cross-origin documents are not loaded in the same browsing context."
msgstr "Isolerer browsing context utelukkende til samme opprinnelsesdokumenter. Tverropprinnelige dokumenter lastes ikke i samme browsing context."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-resource-policy.php:46
msgid "Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy (CORP)"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy (CORP)"

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-resource-policy.php:49
msgid "Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy"
msgstr "Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy"

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-resource-policy.php:50
msgid "The HTTP Content-Security-Policy response header allows web site administrators to control resources the user agent is allowed to load for a given page. With a few exceptions, policies mostly involve specifying server origins and script endpoints. This helps guard against cross-site scripting attacks (Cross-site_scripting). "
msgstr "HTTP Content-Security-Policy responsheaderen lar nettsideadministratorer kontrollere ressurser som brukeragenten har lov til å laste for en gitt side. Med noen få unntak involverer policyer for det meste å spesifisere serveropprinnelser og skriptendepunkter. Dette hjelper til med å beskytte mot tverrside skriptangrep (Cross-site_scripting)."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-resource-policy.php:52
msgid "Only requests from the same Site can read the resource."
msgstr "Kun forespørsler fra samme nettsted kan lese ressursen."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-resource-policy.php:53
msgid "Only requests from the same origin (i.e. scheme + host + port) can read the resource."
msgstr "Kun forespørsler fra samme opprinnelse (dvs. skjema + vert + port) kan lese ressursen."

#: modules/components/security-header-cross-origin-resource-policy.php:54
msgid "Requests from any origin (both same-site and cross-site) can read the resource. This is useful when COEP is used"
msgstr "Forespørsler fra enhver opprinnelse (både samme nettsted og tverrnettsted) kan lese ressursen. Dette er nyttig når COEP brukes"

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:46 modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:49
msgid "Permissions Policy"
msgstr "Permissions Policy"

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:53
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to gather information about the acceleration of the device through the Accelerometer interface."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å samle informasjon om akselerasjonen til enheten gjennom Accelerometer-grensesnittet."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:54
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to gather information about the amount of light in the environment around the device through the AmbientLightSensor interface."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å samle informasjon om mengden lys i miljøet rundt enheten gjennom AmbientLightSensor-grensesnittet."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:55
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to autoplay media requested through the HTMLMediaElement interface. When this policy is disabled and there were no user gestures, the Promise returned by HTMLMediaElement.play() will reject with a DOMException. The autoplay attribute on <audio> and <video> elements will be ignored."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å automatisk avspille media forespurt gjennom HTMLMediaElement-grensesnittet. Når denne policyen er deaktivert og det ikke var noen brukergester, vil Promise returnert av HTMLMediaElement.play() avvise med en DOMException. autoplay-attributtet på <audio> og <video> elementer vil bli ignorert."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:56
msgid "Controls whether the use of the Battery Status API is allowed. When this policy is disabled, the Promise returned by Navigator.getBattery() will reject with a NotAllowedError DOMException."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om bruk av Battery Status API er tillatt. Når denne policyen er deaktivert, vil Promise returnert av Navigator.getBattery() avvise med en NotAllowedError DOMException."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:57
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use video input devices. When this policy is disabled, the Promise returned by getUserMedia() will reject with a NotAllowedError DOMException."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å bruke videoinngangsenheter. Når denne policyen er deaktivert, vil Promise returnert av getUserMedia() avvise med en NotAllowedError DOMException."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:58
msgid "Controls whether or not the current document is permitted to use the getDisplayMedia() method to capture screen contents. When this policy is disabled, the promise returned by getDisplayMedia() will reject with a NotAllowedError if permission is not obtained to capture the display's contents."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har tillatelse til å bruke getDisplayMedia()-metoden for å fange skjerminnhold. Når denne policyen er deaktivert, vil promise returnert av getDisplayMedia() avvise med en NotAllowedError hvis tillatelse ikke er innhentet for å fange skjermens innhold."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:59
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to set document.domain. When this policy is disabled, attempting to set document.domain will fail and cause a SecurityError DOMException to be thrown."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å sette document.domain. Når denne policyen er deaktivert, vil forsøk på å sette document.domain mislykkes og forårsake at en SecurityError DOMException kastes."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:60
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use the Encrypted Media Extensions API (EME). When this policy is disabled, the Promise returned by Navigator.requestMediaKeySystemAccess() will reject with a DOMException."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å bruke Encrypted Media Extensions API (EME). Når denne policyen er deaktivert, vil Promise returnert av Navigator.requestMediaKeySystemAccess() avvise med en DOMException."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:61
msgid "Controls whether tasks should execute in frames while they're not being rendered (e.g. if an iframe is hidden or display: none)."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om oppgaver skal utføres i rammer mens de ikke gjengis (f.eks. hvis en iframe er skjult eller display: none)."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:62
msgid "Controls whether tasks should execute in frames while they're outside of the visible viewport."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om oppgaver skal utføres i rammer mens de er utenfor det synlige visningsområdet."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:63
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use Element.requestFullScreen(). When this policy is disabled, the returned Promise rejects with a TypeError."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å bruke Element.requestFullScreen(). Når denne policyen er deaktivert, avviser den returnerte Promise med en TypeError."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:64
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use the Gamepad API. When this policy is disabled, calls to Navigator.getGamepads() will throw a SecurityError DOMException, and the gamepadconnected and gamepaddisconnected events will not fire. "
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å bruke Gamepad API. Når denne policyen er deaktivert, vil kall til Navigator.getGamepads() kaste en SecurityError DOMException, og gamepadconnected og gamepaddisconnected hendelser vil ikke utløses."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:65
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use the Geolocation Interface. When this policy is disabled, calls to getCurrentPosition() and watchPosition() will cause those functions' callbacks to be invoked with a GeolocationPositionError code of PERMISSION_DENIED."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å bruke Geolocation Interface. Når denne policyen er deaktivert, vil kall til getCurrentPosition() og watchPosition() føre til at disse funksjonenes tilbakeringinger påkalles med en GeolocationPositionError kode på PERMISSION_DENIED."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:66
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to gather information about the orientation of the device through the Gyroscope interface."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å samle informasjon om enhetens orientering gjennom Gyroscope-grensesnittet."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:67
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to show layout animations."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å vise layoutanimasjoner."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:68
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to display images in legacy formats."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å vise bilder i eldre formater."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:69
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to gather information about the orientation of the device through the Magnetometer interface."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å samle informasjon om enhetens orientering gjennom Magnetometer-grensesnittet."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:70
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use audio input devices. When this policy is disabled, the Promise returned by MediaDevices.getUserMedia() will reject with a NotAllowedError."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å bruke lydinngangsenheter. Når denne policyen er deaktivert, vil Promise returnert av MediaDevices.getUserMedia() avvise med en NotAllowedError."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:71
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use the Web MIDI API. When this policy is disabled, the Promise returned by Navigator.requestMIDIAccess() will reject with a DOMException."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å bruke Web MIDI API. Når denne policyen er deaktivert, vil Promise returnert av Navigator.requestMIDIAccess() avvise med en DOMException."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:72
msgid "Controls the availability of mechanisms that enables the page author to take control over the behavior of spatial navigation, or to cancel it outright."
msgstr "Kontrollerer tilgjengeligheten av mekanismer som gjør at sideforfatteren kan ta kontroll over oppførselen til romlig navigering, eller avbryte den helt."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:73
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to download and display large images."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å laste ned og vise store bilder."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:74
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use the Payment Request API. When this policy is enabled, the PaymentRequest() constructor will throw a SecurityError DOMException."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å bruke Payment Request API. Når denne policyen er aktivert, vil PaymentRequest() konstruktøren kaste en SecurityError DOMException."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:75
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to play a video in a Picture-in-Picture mode via the corresponding API."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å spille av en video i Picture-in-Picture modus via det tilsvarende API-et."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:76
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use the Web Authentication API to retrieve already stored public-key credentials, i.e. via navigator.credentials.get({publicKey: ..., ...})."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å bruke Web Authentication API for å hente allerede lagrede offentlige nøkkelreferanser, dvs. via navigator.credentials.get({publicKey: ..., ...})."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:77
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use the Audio Output Devices API to list and select speakers."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å bruke Audio Output Devices API for å liste og velge høyttalere."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:78
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to make synchronous XMLHttpRequest requests."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å gjøre synkrone XMLHttpRequest forespørsler."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:79
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to download and display unoptimized images."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å laste ned og vise uoptimaliserte bilder."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:80
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to change the size of media elements after the initial layout is complete."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å endre størrelsen på mediaelementer etter at den innledende layouten er fullført."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:81
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use the WebUSB API."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å bruke WebUSB API."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:82
msgid "Controls whether the current document is allowed to use Screen Wake Lock API to indicate that device should not turn off or dim the screen."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har lov til å bruke Screen Wake Lock API for å indikere at enheten ikke skal slå av eller demme skjermen."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:83
msgid "Controls whether or not the current document is allowed to use the Navigator.share() of Web Share API to share text, links, images, and other content to arbitrary destinations of user's choice, e.g. mobile apps."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har tillatelse til å bruke Navigator.share() av Web Share API for å dele tekst, lenker, bilder og annet innhold til vilkårlige destinasjoner av brukerens valg, f.eks. mobilapper."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:84
msgid "Controls whether or not the current document is allowed to use the WebXR Device API to interact with a WebXR session."
msgstr "Kontrollerer om gjeldende dokument har tillatelse til å bruke WebXR Device API for å samhandle med en WebXR-økt."

#: modules/components/security-header-permissions-policy.php:176
msgid "Enabled"
msgstr "Aktivert"

#: modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:47 modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:50
msgid "Referrer-Policy"
msgstr "Referrer-Policy"

#: modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:51
msgid "The Referrer-Policy HTTP header determines the amount of referral information (sent through the Referer header) that should accompany requests. In addition to the HTTP header, this policy can also be set in HTML"
msgstr "Referrer-Policy HTTP-headeren bestemmer mengden henvisningsinformasjon (sendt gjennom Referer-headeren) som skal følge med forespørsler. I tillegg til HTTP-headeren kan denne policyen også settes i HTML"

#: modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:53
msgid "The Referer header will be omitted: sent requests do not include any referrer information."
msgstr "Referer-headeren vil utelates: sendte forespørsler inkluderer ikke noen henvisningsinformasjon."

#: modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:54
msgid "Send the origin, path, and querystring in Referer when the protocol security level stays the same or improves (HTTP→HTTP, HTTP→HTTPS, HTTPS→HTTPS). Don't send the Referer header for requests to less secure destinations (HTTPS→HTTP, HTTPS→file)."
msgstr "Send opprinnelse, sti og spørringsstreng i Referer når protokollsikkerhetsnivået forblir det samme eller forbedres (HTTP→HTTP, HTTP→HTTPS, HTTPS→HTTPS). Ikke send Referer-headeren for forespørsler til mindre sikre destinasjoner (HTTPS→HTTP, HTTPS→file)."

#: modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:55
msgid "Send only the origin in the Referer header. For example, a document at https://example.com/page.html will send the referrer https://example.com/."
msgstr "Send kun opprinnelsen i Referer-headeren. For eksempel vil et dokument på https://example.com/page.html sende henviseren https://example.com/."

#: modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:56
msgid "When performing a same-origin request to the same protocol level (HTTP→HTTP, HTTPS→HTTPS), send the origin, path, and query string. Send only the origin for cross origin requests and requests to less secure destinations (HTTPS→HTTP)."
msgstr "Når du utfører en samme opprinnelse forespørsel til samme protokollnivå (HTTP→HTTP, HTTPS→HTTPS), send opprinnelse, sti og spørringsstreng. Send kun opprinnelsen for tverropprinnelige forespørsler og forespørsler til mindre sikre destinasjoner (HTTPS→HTTP)."

#: modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:57
msgid "Send the origin, path, and query string for same-origin requests. Don't send the Referer header for cross-origin requests."
msgstr "Send opprinnelse, sti og spørringsstreng for samme opprinnelse forespørsler. Ikke send Referer-headeren for tverropprinnelige forespørsler."

#: modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:58
msgid "Send only the origin when the protocol security level stays the same (HTTPS→HTTPS). Don't send the Referer header to less secure destinations (HTTPS→HTTP)."
msgstr "Send kun opprinnelsen når protokollsikkerhetsnivået forblir det samme (HTTPS→HTTPS). Ikke send Referer-headeren til mindre sikre destinasjoner (HTTPS→HTTP)."

#: modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:59
msgid "Send the origin, path, and querystring when performing a same-origin request. For cross-origin requests send the origin (only) when the protocol security level stays same (HTTPS→HTTPS). Don't send the Referer header to less secure destinations (HTTPS→HTTP)."
msgstr "Send opprinnelse, sti og spørringsstreng når du utfører en samme opprinnelse forespørsel. For tverropprinnelige forespørsler send opprinnelsen (kun) når protokollsikkerhetsnivået forblir det samme (HTTPS→HTTPS). Ikke send Referer-headeren til mindre sikre destinasjoner (HTTPS→HTTP)."

#: modules/components/security-header-referrer-policy.php:60
msgid "Send the origin, path, and query string when performing any request, regardless of security."
msgstr "Send opprinnelse, sti og spørringsstreng når du utfører enhver forespørsel, uavhengig av sikkerhet."

#: modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:47 modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:50
msgid "Strict-Transport-Security (HSTS)"
msgstr "Strict-Transport-Security (HSTS)"

#: modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:51
msgid "The HTTP Strict-Transport-Security response header (often abbreviated as HSTS) informs browsers that the site should only be accessed using HTTPS, and that any future attempts to access it using HTTP should automatically be converted to HTTPS."
msgstr "HTTP Strict-Transport-Security responsheaderen (ofte forkortet som HSTS) informerer nettlesere om at nettstedet bare skal aksesseres ved bruk av HTTPS, og at alle fremtidige forsøk på å aksessere det ved bruk av HTTP automatisk skal konverteres til HTTPS."

#: modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:53
msgid "The time, in seconds, that the browser should remember that a site is only to be accessed using HTTPS."
msgstr "Tiden, i sekunder, som nettleseren skal huske at et nettsted bare skal aksesseres ved bruk av HTTPS."

#: modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:54
msgid "If this optional parameter is specified, this rule applies to all of the site's subdomains as well."
msgstr "Hvis denne valgfrie parameteren er spesifisert, gjelder denne regelen for alle nettstedets underdomener også."

#: modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:55
msgid "See Preloading Strict Transport Security for details. Not part of the specification."
msgstr "Se Preloading Strict Transport Security for detaljer. Ikke en del av spesifikasjonen."

#: modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:114
msgid "hour"
msgstr "time"

#: modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:115
msgid "day"
msgstr "dag"

#: modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:116 modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:117 modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:118
msgid "days"
msgstr "dager"

#: modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:119
msgid "year"
msgstr "år"

#: modules/components/security-header-stricy-transport-security.php:120
msgid "years"
msgstr "år"

#: modules/components/security-header-x-content-type-options.php:46 modules/components/security-header-x-content-type-options.php:49
msgid "X-Content-Type-Options"
msgstr "X-Content-Type-Options"

#: modules/components/security-header-x-content-type-options.php:50
msgid "The X-Content-Type-Options response HTTP header is a marker used by the server to indicate that the MIME types advertised in the Content-Type headers should be followed and not be changed. The header allows you to avoid MIME type sniffing by saying that the MIME types are deliberately configured."
msgstr "X-Content-Type-Options HTTP responsheaderen er en markør brukt av serveren for å indikere at MIME-typene annonsert i Content-Type headere skal følges og ikke endres. Headeren lar deg unngå MIME-type sniffing ved å si at MIME-typene er bevisst konfigurert."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-content-type-options.php:51
msgid "This header was introduced by Microsoft in IE 8 as a way for webmasters to block content sniffing that was happening and could transform non-executable MIME types into executable MIME types. Since then, other browsers have introduced it, even if their MIME sniffing algorithms were less aggressive."
msgstr "Denne headeren ble introdusert av Microsoft i IE 8 som en måte for webmastere å blokkere innholdssniffing som skjedde og kunne transformere ikke-eksekverbare MIME-typer til eksekverbare MIME-typer. Siden den gang har andre nettlesere introdusert den, selv om deres MIME-sniffing-algoritmer var mindre aggressive."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-content-type-options.php:52
msgid "Starting with Firefox 72, top-level documents also avoid MIME sniffing (if Content-type is provided). This can cause HTML web pages to be downloaded instead of being rendered when they are served with a MIME type other than text/html. Make sure to set both headers correctly."
msgstr "Med start med Firefox 72, unngår toppnivådokumenter også MIME-sniffing (hvis Content-type er gitt). Dette kan føre til at HTML-nettsider lastes ned i stedet for å bli gjengitt når de serveres med en MIME-type annet enn text/html. Pass på å sette begge headerne riktig."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-content-type-options.php:54
msgid "Blocks a request if the request destination is of type style and the MIME type is not text/css, or of type script and the MIME type is not a JavaScript MIME type."
msgstr "Blokkerer en forespørsel hvis forespørselens destinasjon er av type style og MIME-typen ikke er text/css, eller av type script og MIME-typen ikke er en JavaScript MIME-type."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-download-options.php:46 modules/components/security-header-x-download-options.php:49
msgid "X-Download-Options"
msgstr "X-Download-Options"

#: modules/components/security-header-x-download-options.php:50
msgid "The X-Download-Options is specific to IE 8, and is related to how IE 8 handles downloaded HTML files. Turns out if you download an HTML file from a web page and chooses to \"Open\" it in IE, it will execute in the context of the web site. That means that any scripts in that file will also execute with the origin of the web site."
msgstr "X-Download-Options er spesifikk for IE 8, og er relatert til hvordan IE 8 håndterer nedlastede HTML-filer. Det viser seg at hvis du laster ned en HTML-fil fra en nettside og velger å \"Åpne\" den i IE, vil den kjøre i konteksten av nettsiden. Det betyr at alle skript i den filen også vil kjøre med opprinnelsen til nettsiden."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-frame-options.php:46
msgid "X-Frame-Options (XFO)"
msgstr "X-Frame-Options (XFO)"

#: modules/components/security-header-x-frame-options.php:49
msgid "X-Frame-Options"
msgstr "X-Frame-Options"

#: modules/components/security-header-x-frame-options.php:50
msgid "The X-Frame-Options HTTP response header can be used to indicate whether or not a browser should be allowed to render a page in a &#60;frame&#62;, &#60;iframe&#62;, &#60;embed&#62; or &#60;object&#62;. Sites can use this to avoid click-jacking attacks, by ensuring that their content is not embedded into other sites."
msgstr "X-Frame-Options HTTP responsheaderen kan brukes til å indikere om en nettleser skal tillates å gjengi en side i en &#60;frame&#62;, &#60;iframe&#62;, &#60;embed&#62; eller &#60;object&#62;. Nettsteder kan bruke dette for å unngå click-jacking-angrep, ved å sikre at deres innhold ikke bygges inn i andre nettsteder."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-frame-options.php:51
msgid "The added security is provided only if the user accessing the document is using a browser that supports X-Frame-Options."
msgstr "Den ekstra sikkerheten gis bare hvis brukeren som aksesserer dokumentet bruker en nettleser som støtter X-Frame-Options."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-frame-options.php:53
msgid "The page cannot be displayed in a frame, regardless of the site attempting to do so."
msgstr "Siden kan ikke vises i en ramme, uavhengig av hvilket nettsted som prøver å gjøre det."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-frame-options.php:54
msgid "The page can only be displayed in a frame on the same origin as the page itself. The spec leaves it up to browser vendors to decide whether this option applies to the top level, the parent, or the whole chain, although it is argued that the option is not very useful unless all ancestors are also in the same origin."
msgstr "Siden kan bare vises i en ramme på samme opprinnelse som siden selv. Spesifikasjonen overlater til nettleserleverandører å avgjøre om dette alternativet gjelder for toppnivået, forelderen eller hele kjeden, selv om det hevdes at alternativet ikke er veldig nyttig med mindre alle forfedre også er i samme opprinnelse."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-frame-options.php:55
msgid "If you specify DENY, not only will the browser attempt to load the page in a frame fail when loaded from other sites, attempts to do so will fail when loaded from the same site. On the other hand, if you specify SAMEORIGIN, you can still use the page in a frame as long as the site including it in a frame is the same as the one serving the page."
msgstr "Hvis du spesifiserer DENY, vil ikke bare nettleserens forsøk på å laste siden i en ramme mislykkes når den lastes fra andre nettsteder, forsøk på å gjøre det vil mislykkes når den lastes fra samme nettsted. På den annen side, hvis du spesifiserer SAMEORIGIN, kan du fortsatt bruke siden i en ramme så lenge nettstedet som inkluderer den i en ramme er det samme som det som serverer siden."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:47 modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:50
msgid "X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies"
msgstr "X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies"

#: modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:51
msgid "A cross-domain policy file is an XML document that grants a web client, such as Adobe Flash Player or Adobe Acrobat (though not necessarily limited to these), permission to handle data across domains."
msgstr "En cross-domain policy fil er et XML-dokument som gir en webklient, som Adobe Flash Player eller Adobe Acrobat (men ikke nødvendigvis begrenset til disse), tillatelse til å håndtere data på tvers av domener."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:52
msgid "When clients request content hosted on a particular source domain and that content makes requests directed towards a domain other than its own, the remote domain needs to host a cross-domain policy file that grants access to the source domain, allowing the client to continue the transaction."
msgstr "Når klienter forespørrer innhold vert på et bestemt kildedomen og det innholdet gjør forespørsler rettet mot et annet domene enn sitt eget, må det fjerne domenet være vert for en cross-domain policy fil som gir tilgang til kildedomenet, noe som tillater klienten å fortsette transaksjonen."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:53
msgid "Normally a meta-policy is declared in the master policy file, but for those who can’t write to the root directory, they can also declare a meta-policy using the X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies HTTP response header."
msgstr "Normalt erklæres en meta-policy i master policy filen, men for de som ikke kan skrive til rotkatalogen, kan de også erklære en meta-policy ved å bruke X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies HTTP responsheaderen."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:55
msgid "No policy files are allowed anywhere on the target server, including this master policy file."
msgstr "Ingen policyfiler er tillatt noe sted på målserveren, inkludert denne master policy filen."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:56
msgid "Only this master policy file is allowed."
msgstr "Kun denne master policy filen er tillatt."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:57
msgid "[HTTP/HTTPS only] Only policy files served with Content-Type: text/x-cross-domain-policy are allowed."
msgstr "[Kun HTTP/HTTPS] Kun policyfiler servert med Content-Type: text/x-cross-domain-policy er tillatt."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:58
msgid "[FTP only] Only policy files whose file names are crossdomain.xml (i.e. URLs ending in /crossdomain.xml) are allowed."
msgstr "[Kun FTP] Kun policyfiler hvis filnavn er crossdomain.xml (dvs. URL-er som slutter på /crossdomain.xml) er tillatt."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-permitted-cross-domain-policies.php:59
msgid "All policy files on this target domain are allowed."
msgstr "Alle policyfiler på dette måldomenet er tillatt."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-xss-protection.php:47 modules/components/security-header-x-xss-protection.php:50
msgid "X-XSS-Protection"
msgstr "X-XSS-Protection"

#: modules/components/security-header-x-xss-protection.php:51
msgid "The HTTP X-XSS-Protection response header is a feature of Internet Explorer, Chrome and Safari that stops pages from loading when they detect reflected cross-site scripting (XSS) attacks. These protections are largely unnecessary in modern browsers when sites implement a strong Content-Security-Policy that disables the use of inline JavaScript ('unsafe-inline')."
msgstr "HTTP X-XSS-Protection responsheaderen er en funksjon i Internet Explorer, Chrome og Safari som stopper sider fra å laste når de oppdager reflekterte tverrside skriptangrep (XSS). Disse beskyttelsene er i stor grad unødvendige i moderne nettlesere når nettsteder implementerer en sterk Content-Security-Policy som deaktiverer bruk av inline JavaScript ('unsafe-inline')."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-xss-protection.php:53
msgid "Disables XSS filtering."
msgstr "Deaktiverer XSS-filtering."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-xss-protection.php:54
msgid "Enables XSS filtering (usually default in browsers). If a cross-site scripting attack is detected, the browser will sanitize the page (remove the unsafe parts)."
msgstr "Aktiverer XSS-filtering (vanligvis standard i nettlesere). Hvis et tverrside skriptangrep oppdages, vil nettleseren rense siden (fjerne de usikre delene)."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-xss-protection.php:55
msgid "Enables XSS filtering. Rather than sanitizing the page, the browser will prevent rendering of the page if an attack is detected."
msgstr "Aktiverer XSS-filtering. I stedet for å rense siden, vil nettleseren forhindre gjengivelse av siden hvis et angrep oppdages."

#: modules/components/security-header-x-xss-protection.php:56
msgid "Chromium only. Enables XSS filtering. If a cross-site scripting attack is detected, the browser will sanitize the page and report the violation. This uses the functionality of the CSP report-uri directive to send a report."
msgstr "Kun Chromium. Aktiverer XSS-filtering. Hvis et tverrside skriptangrep oppdages, vil nettleseren rense siden og rapportere overtredelsen. Dette bruker funksjonaliteten til CSP report-uri direktivet for å sende en rapport."

